>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default section-width-wide section-has-background" id="uvod"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-image"><div class="flexcard flexcard-card flexcard-size--normal flexcard-media-right valign-center align-left"><div class="flexcard-media"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-original" href="/vyzkouset-zdarma" style="padding-bottom:91.14583333333334%"><img alt="Čtečka dokladů" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width:1459px) 50vw, (min-width:720px) 50.00vw, 100.00vw" src="/files/r/1280/hdr-top-ctecka-dokladu.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/hdr-top-ctecka-dokladu.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/hdr-top-ctecka-dokladu.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/hdr-top-ctecka-dokladu.webp 1920w"/></a></div></div><div class="flexcard-content"><div class="flexcard-content-wrapper"><div class="text-block"><p><a href="/produkty"><strong><span class="text-highlight"><span style="font-family: var(--headings-font-family); font-style: var(--headings-text-italic); text-transform: var(--headings-text-transform); text-decoration: var(--headings-text-underline); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 150);"><font color="#ff0096" size="3">VŠECHNY PRODUKTY</font></span></span></strong></a></p>
<h1>Čtečka dokladů</h1>
<p class="text-large">Údaje o svých hotelových hostech můžete do hotelového systému rychle načítat přímo z jejich dokladů pomocí čtečky. Pomocí stejné čtečky pak můžete načítat i údaje o platebních kartách. </p>
<p class="text-large"><a href="#funkce"><strong><span class="text-highlight"><span style="font-family: var(--headings-font-family); font-style: var(--headings-text-italic); text-transform: var(--headings-text-transform); text-decoration: var(--headings-text-underline); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 150);"><font color="#ff0096" size="3">ZJISTIT VÍCE →</font></span></span></strong></a></p>
</div><div class="image-btn"><a class="btn btn-default" href="/vyzkouset-zdarma"><span aria-hidden="true" class="btn__icon"></span><span class="btn__label">VYZKOUŠET ZDARMA</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-gallery grid-sm-2"><div class="grid gallery-container" style="--gap:40px"><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Hotel Perk" decoding="async" src="/files/ref-hotel-perk-michelin-key-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Mamaison" decoding="async" src="/files/ref-mamaison-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo CPI Hotels" decoding="async" src="/files/ref-cpi-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Fantastický hotel" decoding="async" src="/files/ref-fantasticky-hotel-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo TMR Hotels" decoding="async" src="/files/ref-tmr-hotels-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch" href="/nasi-zakaznici"><img alt="Vaše logo" decoding="async" src="/files/ref-vase-2025.svg"/></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section-background" style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"></div></div>
